msgid "You can also use the following way:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/general/helpers.rst:141
msgid ""
"The functions within files loaded this way are not truly namespaced. The "
"namespace is simply used as a convenient way to locate the files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/general/helpers.rst:147
msgid "Auto-loading Helpers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/general/helpers.rst:151
msgid ""
"If you find that you need a particular helper globally throughout your "
"application, you can tell CodeIgniter to auto-load it during system "
"initialization. This is done by opening the **app/Config/Autoload.php** "
"file and adding the helper to the ``$helpers`` property."
msgstr ""

